[597] (w=67)                                                                    [0m]8;;
[598] (w=67)  You can mimic the behavior in tmux, but it will be more           [0m]8;;
[599] (w=67)  “assembled.”                                                      [0m]8;;
[600] (w=67)                                                                    [0m]8;;
