[1140] (w=67)                                                                    [0m]8;;
[1141] (w=67)  In the left list, you’d see entries like:                         [0m]8;;
[1142] (w=67)                                                                    [0m]8;;
[1143] (w=67)  [38;2;59;66;97m```text[39m                                                           [0m]8;;
[1144] (w=67)    work:2.1  pi      herdr                                         [0m]8;;
[1145] (w=67)    work:2.2  codex   docs                                          [0m]8;;
[1146] (w=67)    ops:1.0   claude  infra                                         [0m]8;;
[1147] (w=67)  [38;2;59;66;97m```[39m                                                               [0m]8;;
[1148] (w=67)                                                                    [0m]8;;
[1149] (w=67)  And on the right, the preview would show the selected pane’s      [0m]8;;
